 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{5329DDC860C1AD1A}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "United States and Russia forces entered the outskirts of Montignac with the objective of securing a cache of high-value supply trucks labeled FOOD."\
     ""\
     "Initial intelligence from both sides classified the crates as military logistics assets; critical to ongoing operations in the region. However, independent sources indicate the supplies may have originally belonged to the local civilian population, leading to growing unrest among residents."\
     ""\
     "End Conditions:"\
     "- A faction with the highest amount of supplies at its HQ after all trucks left the Montignac OR TL reached: Victory"\
     "- A faction reduced to near-total losses or combat-ineffective: Defeat"\
     ""\
     "45 minute TL + 3 minutes setup."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0DB22776F4B6C7A1}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "Confidential Briefing: "\
     "Operation Iron Sweep"\
     ""\
     "Command has identified a priority objective in a contested civilian zone; containers marked FOOD (Field-Oriented Operations Deployment). These trucks are believed to contain mission-critical logistics assets, previously under control of hostile irregulars."\
     ""\
     "These supplies support broader stability efforts in the region. Your performance ensures safety and order for all. Stay sharp, stay fast, freedom depends on you."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{27415A10EDB73428}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "Russian Armed Forces Command:"\
     "Directive: Operation Bastion Freight"\
     ""\
     "Strategic materials have been detected in the central sector of a former resistance-aligned town. The containers, labeled FOOD (Forces-Oriented Operational Distribution), are essential to sustaining long-term efforts in the region and must be reclaimed."\
     ""\
     "These assets will be reallocated for the betterment of the people under Russian protection. The West seeks to destabilize us, your mission ensures our strength and unity endure. Act decisively. "\
     ""\
     "Serve with honor."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E5F1B0DEF49762F1}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "Platoon-strength USAF."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{940C98E66A0FCCDC}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "Platoon-strength Russians."
     m_aFactionKeys {
