     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B6081338F965EF2C}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "Time: 1200 hours; June 27th, 2020"\
     "Location: Montignac, Everon"\
     "Weather: Clear skies, Midday"\
     ""\
     "Your task is to enter the town, secure as many trucks as possible, and extract them to HQ. Resistance from both Russian forces and local militias is expected. Rules of engagement are active. Extract back to the HQ once the trucks are secured."\
     ""\
     "Orders:"\
     "- Secure FOOD transport trucks and transport them to your HQ (Supply Depot)."\
     "- Prevent enemy forces from extracting supplies."\
     ""\
     "End Conditions:"\
     "- A faction with the highest amount of supplies at its HQ after 45 minutes OR all trucks left AO: Victory"\
     "- A faction reduced to near-total losses or combat-ineffective: Defeat"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E4DD3C2D6DCAAECE}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "Time: 1200 hours; June 27th, 2020"\
     "Location: Montignac, Everon"\
     "Weather: Clear skies, Midday"\
     ""\
     "You are to seize and transport as many of these trucks as possible to Russia lines. Expect interference from americans and remaining civilian resistance factions. Engage with force and suppress any obstruction."\
     ""\
     "Orders:"\
     "- Secure FOOD transport trucks and transport them to your HQ (Supply Depot)."\
     "- Prevent enemy forces from extracting supplies."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1F32F599148EA4F0}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "V. Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "Notes about trucks: "\
     "- All trucks are hidden in the garages."\
     "- Each truck’s exact location is randomized at mission start, except Center. "\
     "- Once a truck reaches HQ, it must offload its cargo and stay parked. A replacement Jeep will spawn to allow the crew to return to the AO. 7 seconds after the Global Message, the fuel in the truck will be gone. Think ahead and park correctly."\
     "- Trucks carry varying amounts of supplies:"\
     "-- North & South: 300"\
     "-- Industry & Farm: 600"\
     "-- Center: 900"\
     ""\
     "End Conditions:"\
     "- A faction with the highest amount of supplies at its HQ after 45 minutes OR all trucks left AO: Victory"\
     "- A faction reduced to near-total losses or combat-ineffective: Defeat"\
     ""\
     "Mission by Hot Mic"\
     "Feedback is appreciated"\
     ""\
     "Fun Fact:"\
     "This is Hot Mic's first mission for the community."\
     "It might be possible to complete the match without seeing PvP in Action if low pop."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
